@title Parts window: Get CAD from TraceParts shows its waiting state with steps
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
@area Parts
# Where the user finds it: Parts window > select a part > Get CAD from TraceParts.
fresh
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Parts
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
expect "Parts"
text 3RT2016
wait 12
key Down
wait 8
expect "Get CAD from TraceParts"
shot button-visible
click_text "Get CAD from TraceParts"
wait 15
expect "TraceParts"
shot waiting-with-steps
